#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The objective of &kasteroids; is to destroy all the asteroids on the screen "
"to advance to the next level. Your ship is destroyed if it makes contact "
"with an asteroid."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your Ship"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When your ship is first launched, it has only basic abilities: Turning, "
"Thrusting and Shooting"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to move your ship, rotate it to face the direction you wish to "
"travel and press the thrust key. Of course the ship has momentum, so you "
"will have to compensate when you select the angle of the ship. Thrusting "
"uses fuel, so you should not use your thrusters more than necessary."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have an unlimited amount of ammunition, so shoot away. Only a limited "
"number of shots can be active at once, though. If you repeatedly shoot and "
"miss, you will find that you are unable to shoot until some of the shots "
"have expired."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your ship has a limited amount of fuel. When all the ship's fuel has been "
"consumed it is unable to thrust anymore. This leaves you immobile, but not "
"defenseless &dash; you can still rotate and shoot."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fortunately the asteroids occasionally release fuel when they are shot. Fly "
"your ship into the fuel symbol to collect it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Fuel Upgrade</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Fuel Upgrade</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Fuel Upgrade</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ship Upgrades"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Occasionally when you shoot an asteroid a symbol will be produced. These "
"symbols represent upgrades to your ship. Fly over the symbol to install it "
"in your ship. The upgrades have a cumulative effect, up to a maximum of 5."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "The improvements available are:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ">Brakes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Brakes stop your ship as quickly as possible. The more brake upgrades you "
"have the faster you can stop, with lower fuel usage."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shields"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shields absorb the collision with asteroids, but use a lot of fuel. You need "
"at least two shield upgrades to survive a hit from a medium sized rock, and "
"3 to survive a large rock. You will also need to have enough fuel to "
"maintain the shield during the strike."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Contraròtles"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The shortcuts are configurable via the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu "
"item."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "The defaults are:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Rotate Anti-Clockwise</action> - <keysym>Left Arrow</keysym>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Rotate Clockwise</action> - <keysym>Right Arrow</keysym>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Thrust</action> - <keysym>Up Arrow</keysym>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Shoot</action> - <keysym>Space Bar</keysym>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Shields</action> - <keycap>S</keycap>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Pause</action> - <keycap>P</keycap>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Brake</action> - <keycap>X</keycap>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &kasteroids;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kasteroids; only has a few options, which can be reached from "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure KAsteroids...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start new game with <replaceable>n</replaceable> ships"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start a new game, you have ships in reserve, in case of an "
"accident ;-). This specifies how many ships you have <emphasis>in total</"
"emphasis> when the game starts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show high scores on Game Over"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If selected, shows all of the high scores each time you finish a game, "
"regardless of whether or not you achieve a high score."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Player can destroy Powerups"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If selected, shooting a powerup destroys it. If unselected, the powerup "
"remains, allowing you to still pick it up."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tips"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here are some tips that may help:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to stop your ship, use the brakes rather than stopping manually. "
"The brakes stop you faster, with less fuel usage."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shields are expensive. They should be used as a last resort. Try to use your "
"thrusters to avoid collisions when practical."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Avoid the edges of the playing field. It's more difficult to see asteroids "
"approaching from the opposite side of the field."
msgstr ""

